  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Mix chickpeas, salt, black pepper, and chili flakes in a bowl.",
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sauté garlic and onion until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add chickpea mixture and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Stir in cumin and coriander. ",
    "Roll out flour to a thickness of about 1/4 inch (6 mm).",
    "Transfer the dough to a baking sheet or pizza stone and spread the chickpea mixture over the dough, leaving a 1 inch (2.5 cm) border around the edges.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15-20 minutes, or until the crust is golden brown and the filling is heated through.",
    "Cut the flatbread into wedges and serve hot."
  ],
